1 NAME Edla Annette /Castrén/
2 GIVN Edla Annette
2 SURN Castrén
2 _MARNM Juntunen
2 NICK Edla
2 NICK Annette
2 NICK Anette
2 NICK Anna
2 NICK Castren
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Saukkokankaan hautausmaa
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hyrynsalmi
3 CTRY Finland
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 MAY 1856
2 ADDR
3 CITY Oulainen
3 CTRY Finland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 MAR 1939
2 ADDR
